# Supervised Learning
Computer ko bhi hum ye examples dete hain.
    
Input Data                 Answer
   ↓                          ↓
Study Hours ────────┐
                    ├──→ MODEL
Attendance ─────────┘
                    ↓
                 Pass/Fail

Input → Features
Correct answer → Label/Target
Model → Pattern learn karta hai
New input → Prediction


              Supervised Learning
                      │
              ┌───────┴───────┐
              ↓               ↓
         Regression      Classification


1. Regression - Number predict karna.
# e.g - house price,
 Area = 1500 sq ft
Bedrooms = 3

        ↓
      Model
        ↓
₹45,00,000

Price ek continuous numerical value hai.

# e.g - Car Price

Car details
    ↓
Model
    ↓
₹7,85,000


2. Classification - Category/Class predict karna
# e.g -> Spam Detection
Email
 ↓
Model
 ↓
Spam / Not Spam

# e.g -> Student

Student Data
     ↓
   Model
     ↓
Pass / Fail



